sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Ask / Activity / Conflicts
    participant API as Existing tenant and READ gate
    participant Store as Immutable source / saved citation
    participant Reader as Lazy complete document reader
    participant Raster as Optional isolated renderer
    User->>UI: Open citation
    UI->>API: GET saved citation?view=passage
    API->>Store: Validate query owner, every source grant, version and exact offsets
    Store-->>API: Unchanged source slice / global offsets / full source hash
    API-->>UI: Authorized context only
    UI-->>User: Exact highlighted passage + nearby paragraphs
    User->>UI: Read complete document
    UI->>API: Fresh full citation + version content + document detail
    API->>Store: Recheck READ and immutable evidence
    API-->>UI: Authorized full text / edition / current review metadata
    UI->>Reader: Lazy import; exact offset highlight
    Reader-->>User: One reflowed reading page / section and match navigation
    opt Configured original PDF raster preview
        User->>API: GET version/pages/actual page number
        API->>Store: Recheck READ before private file access
        API->>Raster: Bounded raster-only child; production OS isolation required
        Raster-->>User: Original page PNG / actual page count
    end
    User->>API: Download original
    API->>Store: Fresh READ check
    API-->>User: Unchanged original bytes
    Note over UI,Reader: Revision change or denied read clears answer/source/reader; no stale-cache reuse
    Note over UI,Store: Conflict grouping is presentation only; every historical query survives
